title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-06-billing-export/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: the DRS exception, the console-only step
├── terraform/          7 resources: dataset, topic, budget, scoped exception
├── scripts/            validate.sh, grant-billing-role.sh
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  the org-policy exception and a 120s time_sleep exist because
#             Cloud Billing writes its own service agent onto your topic.
# scripts/    grant-billing-role.sh does the grant over REST - the gcloud
#             form dies with INVALID_ARGUMENT naming no argument.
